_text":"As long as this creature is enchanted by exactly one Aura, it has base power and toughness 3/3.\nAs long as this creature is enchanted by exactly two Auras, it has base power and toughness 5/5 and vigilance.\nAs long as this creature is enchanted by three or more Auras, it has base power and toughness 10/10, vigilance, and trample.","power":"1","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2023-09-08","toughness":"1","type_line":"Artifact Creature — Knight"},{"cmc":4.0,"color_identity":[],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{4}","name":"Vedalken Orrery","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","oracle_text":"You may cast spells as though they had flash.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2022-07-08","toughness":null,"type_line":"Artifact"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"Timber Paladin's abilities each overwrite any previous effects that set creatures' power and/or toughness to specific numbers. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Timber Paladin enters the battlefield will overwrite these effects, regardless of when Timber Paladin became enchanted by one, two, or three or more Auras.","oracle_id":"0be44c76-9e3f-45c2-9b2c-6a5f00678780","published_at":"2023-09-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Diminish overwrites all previous effects that set the target creature’s power and toughness to specific values. Other effects that set its power or toughness to specific values that start to apply after Diminish resolves will overwrite this effect.","oracle_id":"3e554ab4-8179-4d3e-84ba-9a67b51cff7f","published_at":"2017-11-17","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Effects that modify the target creature’s power or toughness, such as the effects of Elesh Norn, Grand Cenobite or prowess, will apply to it no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters).","oracle_id":"3e554ab4-8179-4d3e-84ba-9a67b51cff7f","published_at":"2017-11-17","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The controller of Vedalken Orrery can cast nonland artifact, creature, enchantment, and sorcery cards any time they could cast an instant. This includes on other players' turns and during the upkeep step, draw step, combat phase, and end step.","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2004-12-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This applies only to casting spells. It does not, for example, change when you may activate abilities that can only be activated \"any time you could cast a sorcery\".","oracle_id":"60d640a4-032b-4279-ac75-8f200ca776fb","published_at":"2010-06-15","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This is not modal. If the target changes from an artifact to an enchantment or vice versa, this still destroys it.","oracle_id":"a7e97fa9-4b72-4548-b854-5be5f18a6f1a","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
